  "changed_since_previous": "Added a functional test checking the reverse ordering: verifying that bitcoind fails during startup if another process is already bound to its P2P listen port.",
  "card": "Sets SO_EXCLUSIVEADDRUSE instead of SO_REUSEADDR on P2P listen sockets on Windows and adds functional tests for port exclusivity. On Windows, default SO_REUSEADDR semantics allow another process under the same user account to bind to an active port and intercept incoming P2P connections. This extends socket exclusivity protections previously merged for RPC listeners in PR #36169.",
